<title>UK: Bodycote surge after paper recommends buy.</title>
<headline>Bodycote surge after paper recommends buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Bodycote International Plc rose sharply on Monday after a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation in the Sunday Times newspaper for the British engineering services company.</p>
<p>At 0840 GMT, the shares were up 32-1/2p at 740p.</p>
<p>The Sunday Times &quot;Inside Track&quot; column said the shares would continue to outperform after an expansion of Bodycote's European heat-treatment division following the 85 million stg acquisition of Brukens.</p>
<p>Bodycote's services are used by the automotive, tooling, power-generation and aerospace sectors.</p>
<p>-- Brian Killen, London newsroom 44 171 542 7972</p>
